WEBVTT

01:41.780 --> 01:48.979
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.320 --> 01:51.870
[Episode 25]

02:03.070 --> 02:03.790
Lin Zhixia?

02:05.950 --> 02:06.840
Lin Zhixia?

02:12.840 --> 02:13.590
Lin Zhixia.

03:20.290 --> 03:26.400
♪ The narcissus rides the carp,
fading away in decay ♪

03:27.780 --> 03:33.880
♪ Dark‑green lurks beneath the sea,
stirring the nebulae ♪

03:34.940 --> 03:41.440
♪ Through countless nights,
you and I march onward ♪

03:42.040 --> 03:48.579
♪ Probing, waking, and gathering
love gone mad ♪

03:49.150 --> 03:54.860
♪ Say yes, and let the present reset ♪

03:56.170 --> 03:59.130
♪ Our first night, my sunset ♪

03:59.570 --> 04:02.810
♪ The whole world, just us two ♪

04:03.190 --> 04:06.370
♪ Sleepless city, rising and falling ♪

04:06.560 --> 04:10.480
♪ Breathing the faint hush of midnight ♪

04:11.050 --> 04:13.540
♪ All around, someone strikes the fire ♪

04:13.880 --> 04:15.280
♪ Lovers burn and wound one another ♪

04:40.010 --> 04:41.720
[Electrocardiogram Report]

04:41.830 --> 04:44.360
[Electroencephalogram Report]

04:44.430 --> 04:46.159
I just feel a bit flustered

04:46.510 --> 04:47.710
and can't sleep well.

04:47.850 --> 04:50.450
Sometimes I feel my heart
beating really fast,

04:50.720 --> 04:51.510
and...

04:53.070 --> 04:55.000
I feel hot for no reason.

04:58.360 --> 04:59.760
According to the report,

04:59.920 --> 05:00.630
your blood indicators,

05:00.630 --> 05:02.510
ECG, and EEG are all fine.

05:05.390 --> 05:07.990
Are you under too much pressure
at work lately?

05:09.240 --> 05:10.480
Not really.

05:14.870 --> 05:15.470
Well then,

05:15.720 --> 05:17.310
you can do a Holter monitor test first.

05:17.310 --> 05:19.120
You have to wear this for 24 hours,

05:19.120 --> 05:20.250
even when you sleep.

05:20.800 --> 05:22.260
Then we'll see how it goes.

05:22.270 --> 05:23.210
If that doesn't work,

05:23.210 --> 05:25.470
we'll do a CT scan
of your heart and brain.

05:26.000 --> 05:27.750
Is that necessary? It's so much trouble.

05:27.750 --> 05:29.410
You have to take it seriously.

05:37.750 --> 05:39.510
Your sleep quality really isn't great.

05:39.510 --> 05:40.909
It's not serious, right?

05:41.070 --> 05:42.330
It's not a big problem.

05:46.480 --> 05:48.000
At around 7:30 last night,

05:48.040 --> 05:49.170
what were you doing?

05:49.510 --> 05:51.170
Your heart rate was a bit fast.

05:51.830 --> 05:52.630
7:30?

05:53.070 --> 05:53.720
Yes.

05:55.150 --> 05:56.720
7:30...

05:59.159 --> 06:01.960
Jiang Yubai chatted with me
for a bit after dinner.

06:08.510 --> 06:09.160
Alright.

06:10.190 --> 06:11.390
I know the reason now.

06:11.760 --> 06:12.870
What is it?

06:19.720 --> 06:21.650
It's just the changing of seasons.

06:21.750 --> 06:23.210
Plus you're a bit nervous.

06:24.240 --> 06:25.040
Just rest more

06:25.190 --> 06:26.430
and don't overthink.

06:29.240 --> 06:30.120
But I can't sleep.

06:30.120 --> 06:32.450
Can you prescribe me some sleeping pills?

06:32.810 --> 06:34.600
You can't take sleeping pills
for no good reason.

06:34.600 --> 06:36.240
I'm reviewing your report out of goodwill.

06:36.240 --> 06:37.510
You're not even
a patient of my department.

06:37.510 --> 06:38.630
How can I prescribe them for you?

06:38.630 --> 06:40.600
Are you sure I have no problems?

06:41.310 --> 06:42.000
I'm sure.

06:47.830 --> 06:48.630
Now off you go.

06:48.950 --> 06:50.150
I need to do my rounds.

06:51.840 --> 06:53.770
Shen Fuxuan insisted I'm not sick.

06:54.430 --> 06:57.240
But I really feel unwell lately.

06:57.430 --> 06:58.560
However, the checkup results

06:58.560 --> 07:00.220
do show that nothing is wrong.

07:02.120 --> 07:03.680
What do those straight guys know?

07:03.680 --> 07:05.540
Tell me, where do you feel unwell?

07:08.790 --> 07:10.450
When I interact with someone,

07:10.870 --> 07:12.600
I get nervous for no reason.

07:13.750 --> 07:15.210
I can't sleep well either.

07:15.440 --> 07:17.240
Sometimes my heart beats so fast

07:17.310 --> 07:19.570
that it feels like it's going to jump out.

07:20.560 --> 07:22.000
Interact with someone?

07:22.340 --> 07:24.570
Who? Jiang Yubai?

07:25.120 --> 07:26.120
How do you know?

07:28.360 --> 07:31.330
I think Shen Fuxuan is right.

07:31.510 --> 07:33.370
You are not sick.

07:33.830 --> 07:35.560
It's a kind of stress response.

07:36.120 --> 07:37.580
A stress response?

07:38.600 --> 07:40.560
It's like a problem

07:40.560 --> 07:42.120
we often encounter during puberty.

07:42.120 --> 07:43.430
We've had it before.

07:44.000 --> 07:45.240
But everyone is different.

07:45.240 --> 07:46.600
In puberty, there are early
and late bloomers,

07:46.600 --> 07:47.940
just like in menopause.

07:48.159 --> 07:50.560
Basically, your puberty is here now.

07:53.310 --> 07:54.680
Then what should I do?

07:56.560 --> 07:58.040
I have a folk prescription.

07:58.040 --> 07:59.000
What is it?

08:00.360 --> 08:02.240
A desensitization therapy.
We'll fight poison with poison.

08:02.240 --> 08:03.360
Aren't you afraid of him getting close?

08:03.360 --> 08:04.800
Then you should get close to him first.

08:04.800 --> 08:07.870
Hug him, cuddle him, and hold his hand.

08:08.160 --> 08:09.430
After enough exposure and attempts,

08:09.430 --> 08:11.960
your body will naturally
become immune to it.

08:14.430 --> 08:15.240
Will it work?

08:15.260 --> 08:17.450
What's the principle behind it?

08:17.870 --> 08:18.750
Don't ask.

08:19.120 --> 08:20.680
Just try it.

08:41.080 --> 08:41.870
Lin Zhixia.

08:43.150 --> 08:46.080
Why do you suddenly want to play
a horror escape room?

08:48.630 --> 08:50.510
I had some problems with my research.

08:50.510 --> 08:52.170
So I came to find some answers.

08:52.360 --> 08:54.480
You can find answers here?

08:58.600 --> 09:00.730
I can look at the mechanisms and stuff.

09:45.510 --> 09:46.600
My bad, my bad.

09:46.600 --> 09:49.330
I forgot to consider
personal tolerance levels.

09:49.600 --> 09:51.600
Should we continue
the desensitization then?

09:51.600 --> 09:52.390
Of course.

09:52.480 --> 09:53.850
If your experiment fails once,

09:53.850 --> 09:54.840
would you just stop?

09:54.840 --> 09:56.840
Besides, you did great this time.

09:56.840 --> 09:58.900
We'll definitely succeed next time.

09:59.030 --> 10:00.030
What's next then?

10:01.720 --> 10:02.720
The cinema.

11:39.840 --> 11:41.040
It's a bit hot in here.

11:41.480 --> 11:42.360
Let's go out.

11:47.320 --> 11:49.250
This movie isn't very good anyway.

11:49.390 --> 11:50.030
Let's go.

11:54.840 --> 11:55.770
I'm speechless.

11:56.050 --> 11:57.600
I really am.

11:57.960 --> 11:59.080
The way your brain is wired

11:59.080 --> 12:01.740
is definitely different
from ordinary people.

12:02.080 --> 12:04.840
Even a rock would get it by now.

12:09.840 --> 12:10.750
What's wrong?

12:11.270 --> 12:11.800
Nothing.

12:12.750 --> 12:13.680
It's my problem.

12:13.840 --> 12:14.630
My fault.

12:15.420 --> 12:16.820
Don't blame yourself.

12:18.840 --> 12:21.200
I really don't
quite understand this problem.

12:21.200 --> 12:22.360
But if, like you said,

12:22.360 --> 12:23.840
everyone goes through it,

12:24.360 --> 12:25.490
then I'll accept it.

12:26.200 --> 12:27.840
I can overcome it too.

12:30.000 --> 12:30.840
You can do it.

12:31.120 --> 12:32.850
Take your time to figure it out.

12:45.030 --> 12:48.360
We asked you to come home
these past few days, but you didn't.

12:48.360 --> 12:49.440
Your mother and I still want to have

12:49.440 --> 12:50.570
a good talk with you.

12:55.960 --> 12:56.840
Go ahead.

12:58.030 --> 12:59.360
About you and Lin Zeqiu,

13:01.150 --> 13:02.410
we don't approve of it.

13:06.080 --> 13:08.010
Didn't you want me to date someone?

13:08.960 --> 13:10.360
Lin Zeqiu is a good person

13:10.480 --> 13:11.270
with a good job.

13:11.270 --> 13:13.840
He got into a big tech company right after
graduation, and his salary is good too.

13:13.840 --> 13:15.600
We've known each other since
childhood and know each other inside out.

13:15.600 --> 13:17.330
What's there to disapprove of?

13:17.840 --> 13:19.370
With your qualifications,

13:19.390 --> 13:21.670
you could even find someone
better than Li Zhe.

13:21.670 --> 13:22.910
Why Lin Zeqiu?

13:23.080 --> 13:23.960
I don't get it.

13:25.720 --> 13:26.960
I like him.

13:27.480 --> 13:28.440
You like him?

13:30.030 --> 13:31.670
In the grand scheme of your life,

13:31.670 --> 13:34.960
liking something or not
is the least important consideration.

13:34.960 --> 13:35.750
Baihui.

13:36.720 --> 13:39.050
We really are doing this
for your own good.

13:39.240 --> 13:41.640
When you were little,
we made you study hard

13:41.910 --> 13:43.000
and not waste time and energy

13:43.000 --> 13:44.440
on other things.

13:45.120 --> 13:47.920
It was all so you could
get into Qingbei University

13:48.030 --> 13:49.670
and lay a good foundation for your life.

13:49.670 --> 13:50.790
You did it.

13:51.360 --> 13:52.030
You stood on a starting line

13:52.030 --> 13:53.870
that's different from others.

13:53.960 --> 13:55.690
This proves that we were right.

13:56.750 --> 13:57.550
Now,

13:58.000 --> 14:00.080
we want you to find a better partner

14:00.360 --> 14:01.550
so that your future life

14:01.550 --> 14:02.880
will be free of worries.

14:05.240 --> 14:06.120
Your dad and I

14:06.630 --> 14:09.090
are pretty much set
in our ways for this life.

14:09.120 --> 14:10.600
I don't want you to spend
the rest of your life

14:10.600 --> 14:11.750
living like us,

14:12.510 --> 14:13.600
feeling stifled.

14:14.480 --> 14:17.030
But I don't think you two
are living a stifled life.

14:17.030 --> 14:18.030
And I'm confident that,

14:18.030 --> 14:19.380
with Lin Zeqiu's and my abilities,

14:19.380 --> 14:21.600
we can live a good life
together in the future.

14:21.600 --> 14:23.960
He works himself to the bone,
but he's just an employee.

14:23.960 --> 14:25.510
He can make some money when he's young,

14:25.510 --> 14:27.480
but his family background isn't strong
enough to weather any storms.

14:27.480 --> 14:29.870
In the future, you'll have kids,
a mortgage, and car loans.

14:29.870 --> 14:32.080
You'll face a lot of pressure
when you're middle-aged.

14:32.080 --> 14:33.840
You don't see these problems now,

14:33.840 --> 14:35.360
but that doesn't mean they won't appear.

14:35.360 --> 14:36.510
How can we not worry?

14:36.840 --> 14:38.960
But Li Zhe's family wouldn't
have this problem.

14:38.960 --> 14:41.240
Even if your family encounters problems,

14:41.240 --> 14:42.750
Li Zhe's family members are all local

14:42.750 --> 14:44.080
and can provide a lot of help.

14:44.080 --> 14:45.840
Tell me, you could have a life
with a house, a car,

14:45.840 --> 14:47.630
and a nanny, but you choose not to.

14:47.630 --> 14:49.120
What's the point of working
so hard every day?

14:49.120 --> 14:51.120
But I don't care about those things.

14:51.840 --> 14:53.150
I don't need a big house.

14:53.150 --> 14:54.510
I don't need a nanny.

14:55.150 --> 14:57.150
I just want to live a simple life

14:57.150 --> 14:58.600
with the person I like in the future.

14:58.600 --> 15:01.400
Jin Baihui, do you not understand
what I'm saying?

15:03.120 --> 15:05.030
Your mother and I won't need you
to take care of us in the future.

15:05.030 --> 15:05.960
But don't you know

15:05.960 --> 15:07.030
the family situation

15:07.030 --> 15:07.720
of that Lin guy?

15:07.720 --> 15:09.050
Can he just ignore them?

15:09.390 --> 15:10.870
You worked so hard to get into
Qingbei University,

15:10.870 --> 15:12.600
just to find a family like this?

15:13.360 --> 15:14.120
Baihui.

15:14.870 --> 15:17.200
We really are doing this
for your own good.

15:18.390 --> 15:19.840
I'm telling you, this is not a discussion.

15:19.840 --> 15:21.770
Move back home immediately today.

15:23.510 --> 15:24.750
We agreed to talk nicely.

15:24.750 --> 15:25.390
Look at her.

15:25.390 --> 15:27.590
She won't listen to anything right now.

15:28.200 --> 15:29.000
Baihui.

15:29.750 --> 15:31.390
You really need to listen.

15:31.390 --> 15:32.920
I've listened long enough.

15:34.150 --> 15:36.630
Please stop doing things for my own good.

15:38.750 --> 15:39.750
I'm not moving.

15:40.910 --> 15:42.510
I'll decide this for myself.

15:56.670 --> 15:57.170
Ms. Zhou.

15:57.170 --> 15:59.270
These are the new business collaborations
for Su Mo this week.

15:59.270 --> 16:02.330
It seems his new drama has
brought him high popularity.

16:03.630 --> 16:05.750
Even though there are no major brands,

16:05.750 --> 16:07.510
the brand tone is quite good.

16:08.670 --> 16:09.910
The positioning is quite smart.

16:09.910 --> 16:10.840
Interesting.

16:14.030 --> 16:16.390
Su Mo, why are you at the company?

16:16.790 --> 16:18.920
Ms. Zhou, I came to deliver a contract.

16:19.960 --> 16:21.600
Your momentum is pretty good lately.

16:21.600 --> 16:23.790
Even though those
external collaborations are small,

16:23.790 --> 16:25.590
you are making steady progress.

16:25.670 --> 16:26.800
Thank you, Ms. Zhou.

16:27.150 --> 16:29.320
It's all thanks to Tingting.

16:30.600 --> 16:32.960
The company's resources are limited.

16:33.720 --> 16:34.510
Sometimes,

16:34.670 --> 16:38.730
following the right person is more
important than doing the right thing.

16:38.750 --> 16:39.750
You're smart.

16:40.480 --> 16:42.410
You should understand what I mean.

16:44.600 --> 16:45.320
Su Mo.

16:46.720 --> 16:47.390
Tingting.

16:49.390 --> 16:50.080
What's wrong, Ms. Zhou?

16:50.080 --> 16:52.140
Is there a problem with the contract?

16:53.080 --> 16:54.940
It's nothing. I was praising you.

16:55.390 --> 16:57.390
This newbie of yours has good taste.

17:03.150 --> 17:03.950
What's wrong?

17:03.960 --> 17:04.920
Did Ms. Zhou make things
difficult for you?

17:04.920 --> 17:05.680
No.

17:05.960 --> 17:07.750
I was just passing by.
So I had a chat with her.

17:07.750 --> 17:08.510
About what?

17:09.599 --> 17:10.960
Nothing.

17:11.589 --> 17:12.880
Just a casual chat.

17:13.030 --> 17:14.270
Don't worry.

17:14.480 --> 17:16.720
I'll go deliver a contract first.

17:23.880 --> 17:28.940
[Star Shine Media]

17:41.800 --> 17:46.520
[Duan Qiyan]

17:48.870 --> 17:49.350
[Duan Qiyan]

17:54.720 --> 17:57.170
[What are you doing?]

17:57.260 --> 18:01.260
[Same place tonight.]

18:04.200 --> 18:05.170
[Hey, reply if you see this.]

18:05.210 --> 18:07.380
[Hey!]

18:07.400 --> 18:09.170
[Are you going or not?]

18:09.200 --> 18:12.940
[Are you there, Tang Tingting?]

18:11.790 --> 18:13.250
I'm busy. Don't bother me.

18:17.750 --> 18:18.910
[What are you doing?]

18:19.050 --> 18:19.920
[Are you there, Tang Tingting?]

18:19.950 --> 18:20.930
[What's wrong?]

18:20.950 --> 18:21.870
[Are you angry?]

18:21.890 --> 18:22.680
[I'll treat you to dinner. Don't be mad.]

18:43.070 --> 18:43.790
Zhixia,

18:43.880 --> 18:45.550
why the sudden call?

18:46.240 --> 18:48.880
There's something I might need to
trouble you with.

18:48.880 --> 18:51.030
It's no trouble. Just tell me.

18:51.400 --> 18:53.000
I'll send you a paper in a bit.

18:54.440 --> 18:55.680
Professor Lin,

18:56.200 --> 18:57.440
I'm just a university undergraduate.

18:57.440 --> 18:59.270
Would I even understand
the paper you send?

18:59.270 --> 19:01.270
Did Tang Tingting ask you to mock me?

19:01.550 --> 19:02.400
Of course not.

19:03.000 --> 19:05.790
I want to apply for the
national project next month.

19:05.790 --> 19:06.920
That's a good thing.

19:07.030 --> 19:08.400
You can definitely do it.

19:08.400 --> 19:09.200
But to apply,

19:09.200 --> 19:12.030
I need recommendations from at least
2 doctoral supervisors in the field.

19:12.030 --> 19:14.480
The professors in our school
with relevant expertise

19:14.480 --> 19:16.830
have their recommendation spots
booked long ago.

19:16.830 --> 19:18.290
So I wanted to ask you about

19:18.310 --> 19:21.750
Professor Liu Qingsong in your
university's School of Mathematics,

19:21.750 --> 19:23.270
the one who does
partial differential equations

19:23.270 --> 19:25.000
and computational mathematics.

19:25.000 --> 19:27.460
He's a leading figure
in our domestic field.

19:27.680 --> 19:29.830
I wanted to ask if you know him.

19:30.160 --> 19:31.680
Could you put in a good word for me

19:31.680 --> 19:32.790
or introduce me?

19:34.160 --> 19:35.670
I just want a chance

19:36.030 --> 19:37.760
to show him our group's report.

19:38.480 --> 19:39.280
I understand.

19:40.000 --> 19:40.790
Prof Liu

19:40.790 --> 19:42.850
is indeed the treasure of our school.

19:43.160 --> 19:45.590
He supervised my major advisor back then,

19:45.590 --> 19:47.240
so in terms of seniority,

19:47.240 --> 19:49.040
he's actually my grand-master.

19:49.270 --> 19:51.070
I can ask my advisor for you,

19:51.070 --> 19:52.400
and let him give it a try.

19:52.510 --> 19:54.440
But Prof Liu is very stubborn,

19:54.440 --> 19:56.640
so I can't guarantee it will work.

19:57.030 --> 19:58.890
It's fine. Don't feel pressured.

19:58.960 --> 20:00.490
I'm just hoping for a chance

20:00.680 --> 20:01.960
for him to see our project.

20:01.960 --> 20:03.480
The project will speak for itself.

20:03.480 --> 20:04.160
Okay.

20:04.640 --> 20:05.480
How about this?

20:05.480 --> 20:06.350
Tonight,

20:06.350 --> 20:08.510
I'll ask my teacher to try.

20:08.510 --> 20:10.070
I'll feel him out first.

20:10.790 --> 20:11.790
Thank you, Duan.

20:12.240 --> 20:14.170
Don't mention it. Wait for my news.

20:25.400 --> 20:26.550
It crashed again?

20:43.510 --> 20:50.120
[Cancel] [Post]

20:46.160 --> 20:47.890
The computer died before I did.

20:47.920 --> 20:48.720
My stomach is protesting.

20:48.720 --> 20:50.200
My brain has gone on strike.

20:50.200 --> 20:51.720
Help me.

21:16.680 --> 21:17.160
Su Mo?

21:18.240 --> 21:19.590
I saw on your Moments

21:19.750 --> 21:21.210
that your computer broke.

21:21.640 --> 21:22.970
I happened to be nearby.

21:23.440 --> 21:25.840
So I bought some
late-night snacks for you.

21:27.310 --> 21:28.000
Come on.

21:28.590 --> 21:29.590
Eat over here.

21:30.110 --> 21:31.160
Let me take a look at your computer.

21:31.160 --> 21:32.000
Can you do it?

21:33.000 --> 21:33.920
I'll try.

21:34.720 --> 21:36.790
Gamers are all computer experts.

21:37.440 --> 21:38.700
Alright, give it a try.

21:50.770 --> 21:59.420
[Tang Tingting]

21:55.590 --> 21:58.880
Being handsome is just one of
my Su Mo's many strengths.

22:03.880 --> 22:04.510
Handsome?

22:05.240 --> 22:06.500
How handsome can he be?

22:21.880 --> 22:22.480
Tingting.

22:23.510 --> 22:25.030
Ms. Zhou came to me today

22:26.160 --> 22:28.350
because she wanted me to join her team.

22:35.440 --> 22:36.440
I turned her down.

22:38.400 --> 22:40.200
I know I made it to where I am today

22:41.000 --> 22:42.590
because when I was at my lowest,

22:42.590 --> 22:43.920
you didn't give up on me.

22:44.750 --> 22:47.550
I know how much pressure
you've shouldered for me.

22:51.750 --> 22:52.960
I didn't tell you then

22:53.480 --> 22:55.270
because I was afraid of upsetting you

22:55.270 --> 22:57.470
and making you think I didn't trust you.

22:58.640 --> 22:59.720
I'm telling you now

23:01.200 --> 23:03.310
because I think the credit
for fixing the computer

23:03.310 --> 23:05.960
should make up
for me keeping things from you.

23:14.590 --> 23:15.400
Tingting.

23:17.160 --> 23:17.830
It's fixed.

23:32.270 --> 23:33.160
Brat,

23:33.640 --> 23:35.370
at least you have a conscience.

24:02.920 --> 24:07.620
[School of Mathematical Sciences
Experimental Center, Qingbei University]

24:15.210 --> 24:19.020
[School of Mathematical Sciences
Experimental Center, Qingbei University]

24:25.550 --> 24:26.400
Engineer Xie,

24:26.980 --> 24:28.350
please temporarily reduce
the resource quota for my project

24:28.350 --> 24:30.000
by a quarter,

24:30.080 --> 24:32.600
and give it to Dr. Lin's group.

24:34.330 --> 24:35.050
Dr. Tan,

24:35.200 --> 24:36.460
didn't you say before...

24:36.460 --> 24:37.340
I know.

24:38.290 --> 24:39.510
Just do as I said.

24:39.550 --> 24:41.750
You can inform their group
about the new schedule.

24:41.750 --> 24:42.400
Thank you.

25:06.680 --> 25:08.340
Why are you here for no reason?

25:10.400 --> 25:11.640
How harsh of you.

25:12.110 --> 25:14.240
Can't I hang out with you for no reason?

25:26.590 --> 25:28.550
Tang, calm down.

25:29.310 --> 25:31.110
First, tell me why you're angry.

25:32.680 --> 25:35.280
And where did this
inverse function come from?

25:47.790 --> 25:48.590
Jiang,

25:49.310 --> 25:50.400
I really don't understand

25:50.400 --> 25:52.510
how I provoked Tang Tingting.

25:52.530 --> 25:54.590
She hasn't talked to me for days.

25:54.750 --> 25:56.400
I sent her so many messages,

25:56.400 --> 25:59.730
and she only replied with a smile emoji.
What does that mean?

26:00.000 --> 26:01.400
You're upset over that?

26:04.790 --> 26:06.400
Don't you know her?

26:06.920 --> 26:08.350
She's been violent since childhood.

26:08.350 --> 26:10.280
I could handle physical violence,

26:10.520 --> 26:12.160
but now she's learned
the silent treatment.

26:12.160 --> 26:14.440
Isn't that more hurtful?

26:14.640 --> 26:16.110
I'd rather she punched me.

26:17.110 --> 26:19.880
Then I can only wish you strength.

26:22.590 --> 26:24.590
What's wrong with girls?

26:24.590 --> 26:26.510
They weren't like this in school.

26:27.240 --> 26:28.200
Why is it that the older they get

26:28.200 --> 26:31.600
and the longer we spend together,
the less I understand them?

26:44.550 --> 26:45.350
Mr. Tao.

26:46.640 --> 26:47.510
Qiyan.

26:48.850 --> 26:50.660
About asking Professor Liu

26:50.660 --> 26:52.920
to recommend the project
you mentioned earlier...

26:52.920 --> 26:53.960
Yes, Mr. Tao.

26:53.960 --> 26:54.750
How did it go?

26:55.750 --> 26:56.510
This afternoon,

26:56.510 --> 26:58.240
I went specifically to see him.

26:58.440 --> 27:01.300
He rejected me before I could
even finish speaking.

27:01.440 --> 27:02.960
You know his temper.

27:03.550 --> 27:05.480
You'd better think of another way.

27:05.680 --> 27:06.830
Okay, Mr. Tao.

27:07.350 --> 27:09.410
Sorry for the trouble. I understand.

27:09.960 --> 27:10.640
Okay.

27:15.590 --> 27:18.190
How am I supposed to explain
this to Lin Zhixia?

27:20.110 --> 27:21.000
Lin Zhixia?

27:21.640 --> 27:22.500
What about her?

27:24.830 --> 27:26.640
She asked me to help her with something.

27:26.640 --> 27:30.170
She'd like Professor Liu to write her
a recommendation letter.

27:31.270 --> 27:32.350
But you have no idea.

27:32.350 --> 27:34.210
This old man is really difficult.

27:34.550 --> 27:37.810
Getting a meeting with him
is harder than reaching the sky.

27:39.240 --> 27:41.240
The Professor Liu you mentioned,

27:41.640 --> 27:42.640
what's his name?

27:43.550 --> 27:44.400
Liu Qingsong.

27:46.830 --> 27:47.590
I see.

27:48.070 --> 27:49.590
Send me Lin Zhixia's materials.

27:49.590 --> 27:50.450
I'll handle it.

27:52.310 --> 27:53.830
Do you know Professor Liu?

27:54.720 --> 27:56.310
If you're talking about the little old man

27:56.310 --> 27:57.720
from your school,

27:58.270 --> 27:59.070
I do know him.

28:02.550 --> 28:04.720
He's the most difficult client
I've ever met.

28:04.720 --> 28:06.640
I have a speaker here
that I modified for him.

28:06.640 --> 28:09.100
I happen to be delivering it
to him tomorrow.

28:11.030 --> 28:12.430
Wow, what a coincidence.

28:14.880 --> 28:16.160
It's a small world.

28:16.830 --> 28:17.440
Okay.

28:17.750 --> 28:20.280
I'll send you the materials
right now, Jiang.

28:21.030 --> 28:21.960
You're the best.

28:34.770 --> 28:37.110
[Runting] [Time-Customized Wedding]

28:39.990 --> 28:44.820
[Runting] [Time-Customized Wedding]

28:44.820 --> 28:46.500
[Inspiration] [Banquet Color]

28:50.670 --> 28:52.450
[Chérie Atelier]

28:52.600 --> 28:55.220
[About Style]

29:01.880 --> 29:02.550
I'm home.

29:02.960 --> 29:03.750
You're back.

29:05.350 --> 29:06.480
Have you had dinner?

29:09.240 --> 29:10.840
I have something to tell you.

29:13.310 --> 29:14.030
What is it?

29:15.200 --> 29:16.200
Have a seat first.

29:23.680 --> 29:24.550
Have I been

29:26.030 --> 29:27.240
in your way lately?

29:29.310 --> 29:30.240
What do you mean?

29:32.960 --> 29:33.590
You...

29:36.940 --> 29:38.870
Do you actually have a girlfriend?

29:38.960 --> 29:41.200
Are you getting married?

29:42.510 --> 29:43.400
I saw wedding brochures

29:43.400 --> 29:44.790
on your desk.

29:45.590 --> 29:46.200
I'm sorry.

29:46.200 --> 29:47.270
I didn't mean to pry.

29:47.270 --> 29:49.000
I just... happened to see them.

29:52.400 --> 29:53.330
You saw them all?

30:00.200 --> 30:01.350
Why didn't you tell me

30:01.350 --> 30:02.680
that you were getting married?

30:02.680 --> 30:04.240
What if she misunderstands?

30:04.240 --> 30:04.880
Don't worry.

30:04.880 --> 30:06.740
I'll pack up and move out tonight.

30:07.400 --> 30:09.310
Sorry for bothering you

30:09.480 --> 30:10.310
all this time.

30:14.720 --> 30:16.580
Is this what you wanted to tell me?

30:22.440 --> 30:24.220
Actually, it's my fault.

30:25.640 --> 30:26.900
I originally wanted to

30:27.310 --> 30:29.510
tell you after everything was settled.

30:32.400 --> 30:33.400
Let me start over.

30:34.030 --> 30:34.830
Jin Baihui,

30:37.960 --> 30:39.490
I want to be your boyfriend.

30:44.550 --> 30:46.350
The kind that leads to marriage.

30:52.440 --> 30:53.240
Wait a minute.

31:03.750 --> 31:05.280
Besides wedding planning,

31:05.310 --> 31:06.640
I've looked at wedding dresses

31:06.640 --> 31:07.750
and houses.

31:08.070 --> 31:09.400
Let me tell you about it.

31:09.590 --> 31:10.480
Because I didn't have much time,

31:10.480 --> 31:11.940
I only found a few options.

31:12.680 --> 31:13.440
But my savings

31:13.440 --> 31:15.900
are enough to pay
the down payment for these.

31:16.000 --> 31:17.930
Let me tell you from the beginning.

31:18.030 --> 31:18.960
The first one...

31:19.920 --> 31:22.120
It faces south and is well-ventilated.

31:22.590 --> 31:24.050
And then there's this one.

31:25.000 --> 31:26.310
The layout isn't as good,

31:26.310 --> 31:27.720
but the lighting is better,

31:27.720 --> 31:29.320
and it has a bright bathroom.

31:29.440 --> 31:30.310
And this one.

31:31.000 --> 31:32.550
The lighting isn't as good,

31:32.550 --> 31:34.020
but the community facilities are better.

31:34.020 --> 31:35.350
Which one do you prefer?

31:38.030 --> 31:39.630
The layout isn't important.

31:39.750 --> 31:41.480
Are they in a good school district?

31:41.480 --> 31:43.070
We need to think about
schooling in the future.

31:43.070 --> 31:45.270
School district... I'm looking for it.

31:46.160 --> 31:46.790
This one.

31:48.000 --> 31:48.680
This one.

31:49.880 --> 31:51.350
This one is assigned
to the City Primary School

31:51.350 --> 31:52.640
and City No. 1 High School.

31:52.640 --> 31:53.660
And this one.

31:53.720 --> 31:55.000
There are no schools nearby,

31:55.000 --> 31:56.400
but there's a private kindergarten

31:56.400 --> 31:57.720
in the community.

31:58.270 --> 32:00.030
And this one. It's my favorite.

32:00.110 --> 32:03.070
It offers direct promotion from
kindergarten to high school.

32:03.070 --> 32:04.750
Which one do you think is better?

32:04.750 --> 32:06.150
What about medical care?

32:06.400 --> 32:08.720
Medical care
is the most important facility

32:08.720 --> 32:09.920
for when we retire.

32:10.110 --> 32:11.880
I have options for medical care too.

32:11.880 --> 32:12.510
This one.

32:13.350 --> 32:14.880
This one is a 15-minute walk

32:15.480 --> 32:16.760
from a top-tier hospital.

32:16.760 --> 32:18.110
This one has no hospital nearby,

32:18.110 --> 32:19.640
but it's in a transportation hub.

32:19.640 --> 32:21.480
A 20-minute taxi ride will get us there.

32:21.480 --> 32:22.830
I've seen all these houses.

32:22.830 --> 32:23.640
They're pretty good.

32:23.640 --> 32:24.400
Pick one.

32:24.400 --> 32:25.400
Pick one you like.

32:26.030 --> 32:27.760
Actually, besides the houses,

32:28.640 --> 32:29.270
I also...

32:30.720 --> 32:31.440
I also...

32:32.820 --> 32:38.490
♪ Only for this lingering warmth
of the moment ♪

32:34.270 --> 32:35.640
Prepared a ring.

32:39.920 --> 32:40.640
I know...

32:39.980 --> 32:45.730
♪ Trading souls with the night ♪

32:41.880 --> 32:43.680
The girl should choose the ring.

32:45.200 --> 32:46.790
But I wasn't going to tell you,

32:46.790 --> 32:52.570
♪ Every dusk I have stolen ♪

32:47.510 --> 32:49.170
so I made the decision myself.

32:49.790 --> 32:50.790
I picked one

32:52.270 --> 32:53.600
that I think you'd like.

32:53.810 --> 32:59.700
♪ Foretells a parting ♪

33:01.970 --> 33:08.180
♪ Where did the storm start brewing ♪

33:06.160 --> 33:07.890
If you don't like it, it's fine.

33:07.960 --> 33:08.790
We can exchange it.

33:08.690 --> 33:14.300
♪ Drenching you before we knew it? ♪

33:09.480 --> 33:10.920
We can go buy one you like.

33:11.310 --> 33:12.640
I'm fine with anything.

33:15.090 --> 33:18.020
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

33:18.740 --> 33:21.690
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

33:22.180 --> 33:24.400
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

33:24.840 --> 33:28.460
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

33:29.230 --> 33:31.570
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

33:32.540 --> 33:35.480
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

33:36.060 --> 33:38.720
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

33:39.240 --> 33:42.370
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

33:43.470 --> 33:46.810
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

33:47.120 --> 33:49.940
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

33:50.550 --> 33:56.550
♪ Hence, time and again, I lose ♪

33:56.980 --> 33:59.800
♪ Myself ♪

34:26.070 --> 34:26.870
What's wrong?

34:27.480 --> 34:28.409
Are you unhappy?

34:30.550 --> 34:31.440
Nothing.

34:36.150 --> 34:37.810
If you don't want to talk to me,

34:38.550 --> 34:40.679
then I won't talk about Professor Liu.

34:43.110 --> 34:44.110
Professor Liu?

34:46.310 --> 34:47.710
Professor Liu Qingsong?

34:47.840 --> 34:48.550
Yes.

34:48.840 --> 34:49.980
I've already made an appointment with him.

34:49.980 --> 34:51.280
At 9 a.m. tomorrow,

34:51.280 --> 34:52.550
he will come visit you.

34:52.710 --> 34:54.630
But since you don't want to talk to me...

34:54.630 --> 34:55.440
Let's talk.

34:55.460 --> 34:56.060
You...

34:56.710 --> 34:58.070
How did you get an appointment with him?

34:58.070 --> 34:58.880
Duan Qiyan said

34:58.880 --> 35:00.480
he's very hard to talk to.

35:01.360 --> 35:02.710
He will definitely come.

35:02.710 --> 35:03.510
Tomorrow,

35:03.630 --> 35:05.620
he'll visit your lab.

35:05.760 --> 35:07.760
Get the materials ready in advance

35:07.760 --> 35:09.690
and just explain it to him clearly.

35:09.900 --> 35:11.480
I've communicated with him a few times.

35:11.480 --> 35:12.280
I told him

35:12.360 --> 35:14.320
a friend of mine
has a very interesting project

35:14.320 --> 35:15.450
worth listening to.

35:15.890 --> 35:17.290
You actually know him?

35:17.400 --> 35:18.550
And you can communicate with him anytime?

35:18.550 --> 35:19.800
You are amazing.

35:21.840 --> 35:23.930
What else don't I know
about you?

35:24.280 --> 35:26.840
It just means you don't know me
well enough.

35:27.400 --> 35:28.190
Dr. Lin,

35:28.190 --> 35:29.630
you have a tough battle tomorrow.

35:29.630 --> 35:32.150
First of all, you
need to eat and sleep well.

35:32.630 --> 35:34.110
Do you want some stir-fried beef?

35:34.110 --> 35:34.630
Yes.

35:34.630 --> 35:35.160
Let's go.

35:36.200 --> 35:38.280
Tell me again what exactly happened.

35:38.530 --> 35:42.060
[Hematology Department Ward]

35:57.760 --> 35:59.090
What are you looking at?

35:59.800 --> 36:01.000
You were so absorbed.

36:03.800 --> 36:06.660
Are you nervous about
the experimental treatment?

36:07.510 --> 36:09.310
It's normal for me to be nervous.

36:11.400 --> 36:12.320
But you,

36:13.590 --> 36:14.400
Dr. Shen,

36:15.150 --> 36:16.800
you seem to be

36:17.110 --> 36:18.710
in a really good mood lately.

36:20.190 --> 36:21.000
Really?

36:25.590 --> 36:27.590
It's probably because a patient recently

36:27.590 --> 36:29.760
has been very cooperative
with the treatment.

36:29.760 --> 36:32.630
She followed every piece
of medical advice meticulously.

36:32.630 --> 36:34.160
It saved me a lot of worries.

36:34.230 --> 36:35.670
Don't make it about me.

36:36.230 --> 36:38.290
It's definitely not because of that.

36:38.920 --> 36:40.380
Then it must be because...

36:45.590 --> 36:47.190
Look at the weather outside.

36:47.800 --> 36:49.130
It's going to rain soon.

36:51.000 --> 36:51.800
On rainy days,

36:54.760 --> 36:56.420
we can finally get a good rest.

37:07.800 --> 37:10.360
How did you get to know Professor Liu?

37:12.760 --> 37:13.760
You know what,

37:13.760 --> 37:17.920
-the canteen's stir-fried beef was great.
-Forget about the stir-fried beef.

37:17.920 --> 37:19.780
I'm talking about Professor Liu.

37:20.400 --> 37:21.510
Professor Liu?

37:23.150 --> 37:23.950
It's raining.

37:25.360 --> 37:26.490
Let's take shelter.

37:33.550 --> 37:34.950
It's raining so heavily.

37:38.510 --> 37:39.440
Wait for me here.

37:39.840 --> 37:41.090
I'll go back to the lab
to get an umbrella.

37:41.090 --> 37:41.880
I'll be quick.

37:41.880 --> 37:42.510
No need.

37:44.230 --> 37:45.290
In such heavy rain,

37:45.730 --> 37:48.060
we'll still get wet
even with an umbrella.

37:48.190 --> 37:49.590
We might as well run back.

37:50.550 --> 37:51.530
Let's go, Jiang Yubai!

37:51.530 --> 37:52.390
Lin Zhixia!

38:36.800 --> 38:38.480
Go change into dry clothes quickly

38:38.480 --> 38:39.740
or you'll catch a cold.

38:40.030 --> 38:40.890
What about you?

38:41.070 --> 38:41.840
I'm fine.

38:41.960 --> 38:43.290
Go change your clothes.

39:57.230 --> 39:59.510
Let me dry your hair for you.

41:31.550 --> 41:32.710
I... Um, I...

41:35.030 --> 41:36.030
The rain stopped.

41:36.190 --> 41:37.520
I... I'll get going now.

41:47.500 --> 41:51.390
[Nano Eraser]

41:49.590 --> 41:51.360
I only realized it later.

41:52.360 --> 41:53.880
Every clumsy approach

41:54.650 --> 41:56.980
and every seemingly unintentional touch

41:57.510 --> 41:59.970
were romantic theorems hidden in formulas,

42:00.920 --> 42:02.590
waiting for the final proof.

42:04.320 --> 42:05.120
It seemed that

42:05.860 --> 42:07.820
before we even confessed our love,

42:09.110 --> 42:11.130
we had already rehearsed the feeling

42:11.130 --> 42:12.500
of being in love a thousand times.
